  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ma5CD8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組的創建目的非常單純：徹底從遊戲中移除配方書。與其他類似模組不同，它不僅僅是隱藏配方書按鈕——NERB 會完全移除其功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/npjTQ2F.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果你在大型整合包中擁有完全解鎖的配方書，並執行 <code>/data get entity @s</code> 指令，你會注意到它回傳了龐大的資料量——其中絕大多數都是配方名稱。安裝此模組後，這些配方名稱將被移除，顯著提升 CraftTweaker 或 KubeJS 等模組的效能（例如在腳本中使用 <code>event.player.data</code> 時）。同時也能加快伺服器與客戶端之間的資料同步速度，並縮短玩家加入世界的時間。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>NERB</strong> 提供多種可設定功能模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DISABLED：</strong>完全從你的物品欄中移除配方書按鈕及其預設功能。</li>\n<li><strong>ENABLED：</strong>保留物品欄中的配方書按鈕，但停用其預設功能，阻止透過配方書管理配方。</li>\n<li><strong>DISCOVERED：</strong>自動解鎖配方書中所有可用的配方。此模式下不會套用其他最佳化。</li>\n<li><strong>TOGGLE：</strong>配方書按鈕仍保留在物品欄中。它不再用於切換配方書，而是用來切換 JEI/REI/EMI 介面的顯示與隱藏。預設配方書功能仍處於停用狀態。此為預設選定模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTSmbVY.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>26.1.2:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=26.1.2&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.11:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.11&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.4:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.21.1:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.6:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Forge</span> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Quilt</span> |&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.4:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.1:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.4: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.2: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.18.2: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.17.1: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.16.5: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.15.2: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.14.4: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rNOClDx.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>問：此模組是否與 X 相容？</strong><br>\n答：大多數情況下是可以的。即使有其他模組與 NERB 的部分功能重疊，其餘的最佳化功能仍會保持不變且正常運作。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將此模組放入整合包中嗎？</strong><br>\n答：可以，歡迎自由加入。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將此模組重新發布到其他網站嗎？</strong><br>\n答：不可以。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4SbaMTb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/nerb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotenoughrecipebook\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<p>undefined</p>\n<div><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想體驗我們的其他模組嗎？— 請造訪 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 獲取更多資訊！</strong></p></div>",
